+<li><strong>Days 31–45:</strong> offer the €7,500 CRA baseline at one scope and price. Offer the €2,500 Data Act module only to the product director. Maximum pre-evidence spend is €5,000 for counsel review, insurance advice, travel, optional language support and a disposable prototype. Build no platform and hire nobody.</li>
+<li><strong>Days 46–75:</strong> deliver at most two paid CRA baselines in each customer's existing tools. Time every task and classify each decision as legal, manufacturer risk, implementation or routine operation. Run the incident clock. Test a product-data path only when its separate module is bought.</li>
